# Zones: a Sampler's key map written by hand (sound-design.md, zone). Below
# C3 the upright piano's F#2 plays the bass; from C3 up the choir pad, looped
# on its sustain so a held chord never runs out; and on the loudest notes from
# C3 up the piano's C4 too, layered over the choir: an accent (!) plays at
# full velocity and reaches the zone that starts at 110.
# Needs the sample packs (make samples).
tempo 90
scale c minor
track keys sampler Sampler SamplerKeys
zone keys 1 = upright-piano-kw/F_2vH : keyhi b2, root f#2
zone keys 2 = synth-pad-choir/C4 : keylo c3, root c4, loop sustain
zone keys 3 = upright-piano-kw/C4vH : keylo c3, vello 110, root c4, level 0.8
strip keys: Send2 0.3

clip hymn = keys
  [c2,c4,eb4,g4]:2 [ab1,c4,eb4,ab4]:2 [f1,c4,f4,ab4]:2 [g1,b3,d4,g4]:2
clip rise = keys
  c2:4 [c4!,eb4!,g4!]:4 g1:4 [b3,d4,g4]:4 ab1:4 [c4!,eb4!,ab4!]:4 g1:2
scene hymn 8: hymn
scene rise 8: rise
arrange hymn rise hymn
